OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would bring in
OL,4,A#10bn UK air defence system as she's
OL,5,Aquestioned over cost
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch is speaking to BBC Radio
OL,8,F4's Today programme - listen and watch
OL,9,Flive above
OL,11,FIt comes as she told the BBC the UK
OL,12,Fshould be "able to protect ourselves"
OL,13,Fas she pledged to invest #10bn in a
OL,14,F"British Iron Dome" air defence system
OL,15,Fif they win the next general election
OL,17,FShe tells BBC Breakfast that the
OL,18,Fprogramme could be paid for with #1bn
OL,19,Fearmarked every year for a decade, and
OL,20,Fthe party has already set out savings
OL,21,Fin areas such as welfare and net zero
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
