OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would bring in
OL,4,A#10bn UK air defence system as she's
OL,5,Aquestioned over cost
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Conservative leader is speaking
OL,8,Ffrom the party's annual conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham - she is due to deliver her
OL,10,Fkeynote speech on Wednesday
OL,12,FOther policies announced by the party
OL,13,Fsince the conference started include a
OL,14,Fpromise to build 50,000 new prison
OL,15,Fplaces and new rules for young people
OL,16,Fclaiming benefits
